# Cursor AI Rules for art-hinduism

# Project Context
This repo contains official Hindu scripture datasets (Upanishads, Vedas, Gita, Puranas, etc.) for All Religious Texts (ART) by CRINE (www.crine.in).

# Key Rules
1. Templates live in templates/, schemas in schemas/, validators in validators/.
2. Run `python3 validators/run_all.py` after editing schemas, tooling, or templates.
3. Follow PEP 8 and Black formatting for Python.
